  "english": [
    "<b>and</b> instead <b>he sprinkled</b> it <b>backward,</b> or if he intended to sprinkle the water <b>backward and</b> instead <b>he sprinkled</b> it <b>forward,</b> even if the water lands on vessels that require purification, <b>his sprinkling is invalid.</b> However, if one intended to sprinkle the water <b>forward and</b> instead <b>he sprinkled</b> it <b>forward to</b> the <b>sides, his sprinkling is valid.</b> It is derived from here that one’s sides are considered as though they were in front of him.",
    "§ <b>Rava bar Rav Huna says: Once a Torah scroll has been opened, it is prohibited to converse, even about a matter of <i>halakha</i>. As it is stated:</b> “And Ezra opened the book in the sight of all the people, for he was above all the people, <b>and when he opened it, all the people stood up”</b> (Nehemiah 8:5), <b>and standing</b> is referring to <b>nothing other</b> than <b>silence, as it is stated: “And shall I wait, because they do not speak, because they stand still, and answer no more?”</b> (Job 32:16). <b>Rabbi Zeira</b> said that <b>Rav Ḥisda said:</b> The prohibition against conversing is derived <b>from here: “And the ears of all the people were attentive to the book of the law”</b> (Nehemiah 8:3). They were not listening to any other voice.",
    "<b>And Rabbi Yehoshua ben Levi says: Any priest who did not</b> first <b>wash his hands may not lift his hands</b> to recite the Priestly Benediction; <b>as it is stated: “Lift up [<i>se’u</i>] your hands in sanctity and bless the Lord”</b> (Psalms 134:2), which teaches that before reciting the benediction one must sanctify his hands by washing them.",
    "§ <b>Rabbi Elazar ben Shammua was</b> once <b>asked by his disciples: To what</b> do you attribute <b>your longevity? He said to them: In</b> all <b>my days, I never made a shortcut [<i>kappendarya</i>]</b> through <b>a synagogue. Nor did I</b> ever <b>stride over</b> the <b>heads of</b> the <b>sacred people,</b> i.e., I never stepped over people sitting in the study hall in order to reach my place, so as not to appear scornful of them. <b>And I never lifted my hands</b> for the Priestly Benediction <b>without</b> first reciting <b>a blessing.</b>",
    "The Gemara asks: <b>What blessing</b> do the priests recite before the benediction? <b>Rabbi Zeira says</b> that <b>Rav Ḥisda says:</b> Blessed are You, Lord our God, King of the universe, <b>Who has sanctified us with the sanctity of Aaron and commanded us to bless His people, Israel, with love.</b>",
    "The Gemara continues: <b>When</b> the priest <b>begins walking</b> to the platform to recite the benediction, <b>what does he say?</b> The Gemara answers: <b>May it be Your will, Lord our God, that this blessing with which You have commanded us to bless Your people, Israel, shall not contain any stumbling block or iniquity. And</b> when the benediction has been completed, <b>when he turns his face away from the congregation, what does he say? Rav Ḥisda instructed Rav Ukva and taught</b> him that this is what he would say: <b>Master of the Universe, we have performed that which You decreed upon us. Do unto us</b>"
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>וְהִזָּה לְאַחֲרָיו, לְאַחֲרָיו וְהִזָּה לְפָנָיו — הַזָּאָתוֹ",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "פְּסוּלָה. לְפָנָיו וְהִזָּה עַל צְדָדִין שֶׁבְּפָנָיו — הַזָּאָתוֹ כְּשֵׁרָה.",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"170\" data-sentence-id=\"1\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabba bar Rav Huna, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2596\" data-full-name=\"Rabba bar Rav Huna\" data-name-he=\"רבה בר רב הונא\">רָבָא בַּר רַב הוּנָא</span><span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"1\" data-marker-letter=\"ב\">ב</span>: כֵּיוָן שֶׁנִּפְתַּח",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "סֵפֶר תּוֹרָה אָסוּר לְסַפֵּר אֲפִילּוּ בִּדְבַר הֲלָכָה,",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״וּבְפִתְחוֹ עָמְדוּ כׇּל הָעָם״, וְאֵין עֲמִידָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֶלָּא שְׁתִיקָה, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״וְהוֹחַלְתִּי כִּי לֹא יְדַבֵּרוּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "כִּי עָמְדוּ לֹא עָנוּ עוֹד״. <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Zeira I, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1017\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Zeira I\" data-name-he=\"רַבִּי זֵירָא א׳\" data-resolution-rule=\"default_early_context\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Defaulted to the earlier figure because no later-context cue appeared nearby.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;heuristic&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Default early context&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Defaulted to the earlier figure because no later-context cue appeared nearby.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology disambiguation heuristics&quot;}]\">רַבִּי זֵירָא</span> אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\">רַב חִסְדָּא</span>,",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מֵהָכָא: ״וְאׇזְנֵי כׇל הָעָם אֶל סֵפֶר הַתּוֹרָה״. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְאָמַר",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Yehoshua ben Levi, first-generation II Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1544\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Yehoshua ben Levi\" data-name-he=\"רבי יהושע בן לוי\">רַבִּי יְהוֹשֻׁעַ בֶּן לֵוִי</span>: <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"2\" data-marker-letter=\"ג\">ג</span>כׇּל כֹּהֵן שֶׁלֹּא נָטַל יָדָיו — לֹא",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "יִשָּׂא אֶת כַּפָּיו, שֶׁנֶּאֱמַר: ״שְׂאוּ יְדֵיכֶם קֹדֶשׁ",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וּבָרְכוּ אֶת ה׳״. <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"171\" data-sentence-id=\"3\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"ב\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>שָׁאֲלוּ תַּלְמִידָיו אֶת <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Elazar ben Shammua, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"477\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Elazar ben Shammua\" data-name-he=\"רבי אלעזר בן שמוע\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-75158\">רַבִּי אֶלְעָזָר</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Rabbi Elazar ben Shammua, fifth-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"477\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Elazar ben Shammua\" data-name-he=\"רבי אלעזר בן שמוע\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-75158\">בֶּן שַׁמּוּעַ</span>: בַּמָּה הֶאֱרַכְתָּ יָמִים? אָמַר לָהֶן: מִיָּמַי",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לֹא עָשִׂיתִי בֵּית הַכְּנֶסֶת קַפֶּנְדַּרְיָא, וְלֹא פָּסַעְתִּי",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "עַל רָאשֵׁי עַם קוֹדֶשׁ, וְלֹא נָשָׂאתִי כַּפַּי בְּלֹא",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "בְּרָכָה. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>מַאי מְבָרֵךְ? אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rabbi Zeira I, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1017\" data-full-name=\"Rabbi Zeira I\" data-name-he=\"רַבִּי זֵירָא א׳\" data-resolution-rule=\"default_early_context\" data-resolution-explanation=\"Defaulted to the earlier figure because no later-context cue appeared nearby.\" data-resolution-reasons=\"[{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;heuristic&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Default early context&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Defaulted to the earlier figure because no later-context cue appeared nearby.&quot;,&quot;attribution&quot;:&quot;Girsology disambiguation heuristics&quot;}]\">רַבִּי זֵירָא</span> אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-75161\">רַב</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-75161\">חִסְדָּא</span>: <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"3\" data-marker-letter=\"ד\">ד</span>״אֲשֶׁר קִדְּשָׁנוּ בִּקְדוּשָּׁתוֹ שֶׁל אַהֲרֹן",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְצִוָּנוּ לְבָרֵךְ אֶת עַמּוֹ יִשְׂרָאֵל בְּאַהֲבָה״. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>כִּי",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "עָקַר כַּרְעֵיהּ מַאי אָמַר? יְהִי <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"4\" data-marker-letter=\"ה\">ה</span>רָצוֹן מִלְּפָנֶיךָ ה׳",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֱלֹהֵינוּ שֶׁתְּהֵא בְּרָכָה זוֹ שֶׁצִּוִּיתָנוּ לְבָרֵךְ",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אֶת עַמְּךָ יִשְׂרָאֵל, לֹא יְהֵא בָּהּ מִכְשׁוֹל וְעָוֹן.",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וְכִי מַהְדַּר אַפֵּיהּ מִצִּיבּוּרָא מַאי אָמַר? אַדְבְּרֵיהּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\">רַב חִסְדָּא</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-unknown\" data-sage-type=\"unknown\" title=\"Rav Ukva\" data-authority-id=\"21222\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ukva\" data-name-he=\"רב עוקבא\">לְרַב עוּקְבָא</span> וּדְרַשׁ: ״רִבּוֹנוֹ <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"5\" data-marker-letter=\"ו\">ו</span>שֶׁל",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "עוֹלָם עָשִׂינוּ מַה שֶּׁגָּזַרְתָּ עָלֵינוּ עֲשֵׂה עִמָּנוּ",
      "segment_ids": [
        5
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rashi": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>וְהִזָּה לְאַחֲרָיו.</b> ואף שם היו כלים הצריכין הזאה: <b>הזאתו</b> <b>פסולה.</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דבעינן כוונה לטהרה כדכתיב (<a href=\"https://www.sefaria.org/Numbers.19.19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-sefaria-ref=\"Numbers.19.19\">במדבר י״ט:י״ט</a>) והזה הטהור על הטמא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שיהא מתכוין לו: <b>עַל <span class=\"dh-divergent\">הצדדין</span> שֶׁבְּפָנָיו.</b> צדדין שיש ממנו ולהלן ולא צדדין",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:1:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שישנו ממנו ולאחור והכי נמי העומדין בצדדין של כהן הימנו ולהלן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:1:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בכלל ברכה הן דכלפניו דמי אבל של",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:1:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אחר הימנו אע\"פ שאינן אחריהן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:1:3",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ממש כלאחריו דמי: <b>״וּבְפִתְחוֹ</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "וכשהתחיל ובעזרא כתיב: <b>עָמְדוּ</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שתקו: <b>שֶׁלֹּא נָטַל יָדָיו</b> לפני עלותו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לדוכן: <b>בַּמָּה הֶאֱרַכְתָּ יָמִים</b> איזה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "זכות בידך שהארכת ימים: <b>קַפֶּנְדַּרְיָא.</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לקצר דרכו דרך בהכ\"נ ליכנס בפתח",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "זה ולצאת כנגדו ולשון קפנדריא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מפרש בברכות (<a href=\"/berakhot/62b\">דף סב:</a>) אדמקיפנא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אדרי איעול בהא עד שאני מקיף",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "סביב השורות הללו אכנס בזה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ואקצר דרכי ודרי שורות בתים: <b>וְלֹא</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>פָּסַעְתִּי עַל רָאשֵׁי עַם קוֹדֶשׁ.</b> שהיו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יושבים התלמידין בבית המדרש על",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "גבי קרקע והמהלך ביניהם כשהן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "יושבין ונכנס לישב במקומו מרחיב",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פסיעותיו בעל כרחו והוא לשון",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מפסע ונראה כמפסע על ראשיהם",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לפיכך צריך להקדים או ישב לו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מבחוץ: <b>ולא נשאתי כפי לברך.</b> שכהן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "היה: <b>בלא ברכה.</b> ברכה דמפרש ואזיל",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:4:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "מאי מברך: <b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">וכי</span> עָקַר כַּרְעֵיהּ.</b> בעבודה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "למיסק והוא מחזיר פניו כלפי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:6:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "תיבה מאי אמר: <b>וְכִי מַהְדַּר אַפֵּיהּ</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>מִצִּיבּוּרָא.</b> כשגומר ברכותיו מחזיר",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "פניו לצד התיבה עד שיגמור שליח",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "צבור המברך את עמו ישראל בשלום:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Sotah 39a:6:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    }
  ],
  "vilna_piskaot": [],
  "steinsaltz_sugyot": [
    {
      "id": 170,
      "sentence_id": 1,
